SUMMARY:🦃✨ Thanksgiving @ Swiss Chalet ✨🍂
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🦃✨
  **Thanksgiving @ Swiss Chalet** ✨🍂\n\nOkay\, so it’s chicken and n
 ot turkey — but it comes with **all the trimmings of a Thanksgiving feas
 t!** 🎉\nJoin me on Thanksgiving for a cozy meal at Swiss Chalet. You ca
 n order whatever you like from the menu\, or opt for their **Festive Speci
 al** (starting at **$18.29 + tax & tip**\, subject to change as we get clo
 ser).\n\n🍗 Quarter Chicken (dark meat\, upgrade to white meat for +$2.0
 0)\n🥔 Choice of side\n🥖 White or multigrain roll\n🍎 Stuffing & cr
 anberry sauce\n🥧 A slice of pie (sometimes selections run out\, so firs
 t come\, first serve!)\nEveryone is responsible for their own meal.\n\n
 📋 **Full menu:** [Swiss Chalet Menu](https://www.swisschalet.com/en/men
 u.html?s=1225)\n\n### 🍁 Coming from the Brick Works Walk?\n\nThis is th
 e **lunch-only event**. If you’re already joining me for the Thanksgivin
 g walk at the Brick Works\, **you do not need to sign up for this event or
  pay another $5 Meetup fee**. The lunch is a continuation of the walk.\nIf
  you’re **only joining us for lunch**\, this is the event you should sig
 n up for. The $5 Meetup fee applies.\n\n📱 Don't forget to join our **Wh
 atsApp Group – [CLICK HERE](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANr
 KAnc)**\n\n***\n\n### Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Location:** Swiss Chalet at
  Yonge & St. Clair — northwest side of Yonge\, just a block north of St.
  Clair.\n🕛 **Meetup Spot:** I’ll meet you outside wearing my **Moose 
 Hat 🦌**. Please don’t go inside until I arrive so we can all sit toge
 ther.\n💲 **Meetup Fee:** $5 cash 💵 or e-transfer 📲 to **[mathewma
 clean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**\n🕑 **Length:** A
 bout 2 hours\, but you’re welcome to leave anytime.\n\n### ⚠️ A Quic
 k Note About Seating\n\nSwiss Chalet does not take reservations\, so I’l
 l give the restaurant a rough estimate of how many people to expect. **Ple
 ase let me know if you’re planning to join us so I can give them the bes
 t number possible.**\n\nPlease **don’t call the restaurant** — they wo
 n’t know anything about this event. Message Mathew directly with any que
 stions.\n\n✨ **Not sure yet? You can just show up on the day!**\n⚠️ 
 Sometimes things happen and I may need to cancel — please keep an eye ou
 t for updates.\n\n👤 **Organized by Mathew.** For questions\, post on th
 e wall or email **[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomovi
 esandoutings@hotmail.com)**
